title: 'Optimize and removed redundant boilerplate of runtimes' xcm-benchmarks'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The refactor focuses on ensure no extra work needs to be done for runtime(s) to understand xcm-benchmarks.

    ### Completed

    - Migrated cumulus runtimes to use Asset Count-based match and filter
    - Migrated polkadot (relay) runtimes to use Asset match-based filter and matching
    - Deleted xcm-benchmarks from custom directory
crates: []
